  "jcr:description": "A talus fracture commonly occurs through the neck of the talus or can involve the ankle and/or subtalar joint. Anatomic reductions of the talus are often necessary as the blood supply to the talus can be affected by fractures and majority of the talus has articular cartilage.\r\n",
